% SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT
% oracle: colour
% Scenario: a triangle mesh driven by a function. Each vertex carries
% one parametric value instead of colour components; the values are
% interpolated across the triangle and the function turns them into
% colours.
gsave
100 400 translate
<< /ShadingType 4 /ColorSpace /DeviceRGB
   /Function << /FunctionType 2 /Domain [0 1] /C0 [1 0 0] /C1 [0 0 1] /N 1 >>
   /DataSource [ 0 0 0 0   0 200 0 0.5   0 100 150 1 ] >> shfill
grestore
showpage
